    "detailed_description": "<h1>Please install free DLC</h1><p>Please install free DLC or the game content is abnormal.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The protagonist of this work Yuwen flame accidentally traversed to a mysterious campus. Wake up Yuwen flame met high cold beautiful Li Xue, cute cute sister little sauce, sexy charming Hou Meiling and other students, they are from different universe of people, everything seems like a dream, but it is true. In order to return to their respective world, the principal of the school stipulated that students could only pass campus exams before leaving the school.\r\n\r\nThis is a role-playing game in which players play the role of a high school traveler, Yuwenflame, and return to the original world through learning skills, developing attributes, card fighting, collecting cards, and interactive gameplay.\r\n\r\nPlay:\r\n\r\nLearning: Through XX days of campus study, learn the attributes of the corresponding discipline, and each attribute will become one card according to the card battle\r\nCombat: Play card battles with NPCS, reward them when you win, draw their cards randomly.\r\nAnd the cards drawn can be replaced by the cards of the corresponding discipline.\r\nExams: Take a test every 30 days, which is a card battle with teachers.",
